holiday-name-spooky-season = Spooky Season
holiday-custom-spooky-season = Spooky season is upon the station! Keep an eye on the vending machines for limited-edition treats.

christmas-cracker-need-hand = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} needs a free hand to pull the other end.
christmas-cracker-pop-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} and {THE($target)} pull a christmas cracker! *pop*
christmas-cracker-pop-self = You pull a christmas cracker with {THE($target)}! *pop*

snowball-scooped = You scoop up a pile of snow and pat it into a snowball.
snowball-packing = You start compacting the snowball.
snowball-burst = {CAPITALIZE(THE($entity))} explodes into a shower of snow!

## Fortune cookie slips

